  "prefLabel": "We 302.03 Businesses Shall Be Licensed",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 302.03 Businesses Shall Be Licensed.\n\n(a) Water well contractor and pump installer's licenses shall be issued to a corporation or other business entity in conjunction with a named qualified individual, as defined in We 302.07.\n\n(b) An employee of a licensed water well contractor or pump installer shall not be required to be licensed.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 300) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
